## bang chung da quan sat (thu_phim / go_loi_phim / thu_xdotool, gio Nano ~10:07-10:12):
- xdotool windowactivate + key q (XTEST), key --window q (XSendEvent), windowfocus + Escape vao cua so 'Xem truc tiep' dang hien: getactivewindow == cua so do nhung KHONG phim nao den waitKey; luot chay het 300 frame (hoan_tat)
- script toi thieu (thu_gtk_phim.py): cv2.waitKey o LUONG CHINH va LUONG PHU deu khong nhan phim xdotool (OpenCV 3.2 tra 255 khi khong co phim)
- zenity --entry + xdotool type 'abc' + Return: zenity KHONG nhan chu nao (-> xdotool khong vao duoc cua so nao khi man hinh khoa)
- anh chup scrot luc 16 s: den hoan toan; import/gnome-screenshot: man hinh khoa (trung binh 25,5)
=> chan THAT: can nguoi dung mo khoa man hinh Nano tai cho (khong dung mat khau qua SSH). Hien thi (imshow) van chay sau man hinh khoa (120/120 frame da ve o lan thu dau).
